OL,3,GNEWSAMulti-vehicle crash and fire
OL,4,Acauses M1 delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree lanes had to be closed on the M1
OL,7,Fin Northamptonshire after a
OL,8,Fmulti-vehicle crash led to a fire.
OL,10,FClosures were put in place on the
OL,11,Fnorthbound carriageway between junction
OL,12,F16 for Northampton and junction 18 for
OL,13,FRugby, Warwickshire, early on Saturday.
OL,15,FThe crash led to travel delays of more
OL,16,Fthan half an hour, with firefighters
OL,17,Fcalled to the scene.
OL,19,FNational Highways said the road fully
OL,20,Freopened at about 08:30 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
